          "evidence": "Statement and proof: Proof 1.1 uses a nearest label in the nonempty finite center set, with ties fixed by retention or smallest index. Proof 1.2 gives the unique arithmetic mean for every nonempty cluster; empty centers are retained, so no unspecified selection is left.",
          "template_review": {
